From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nobody <>
Date: Fri, 17 Jul 2026 10:01:51 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] ggml-cuda: improve NVFP4 W4A4 activation quantization
 (upstream #25730)

---
